68eb522b55f9e9a0a62c1c86</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:27Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T20:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/tankers-carrying-russian-diesel-to-the-us-change-course/a-79870807--b4298bca46ea.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/tankers-carrying-russian-diesel-to-the-us-change-course/a-79870807?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Despite an ostensible deal between Donald Trump and Vladimir Putin to bring diesel to the US, tankers are reportedly unable to dock due to existing sanctions.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Stephen Miller named by Trump as new White House chief of staff</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8d1474bc51d6cfc22c6969ff14d4eae704cabfe3ee2e9eb637a3f902836ac267</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:27Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T20:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/stephen-miller-named-by-trump-as-new-white-house-chief-of-staff/a-79881571--b75b041f5990.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/stephen-miller-named-by-trump-as-new-white-house-chief-of-staff/a-79881571?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Trump said he would be replacing Susie Wiles for the top advisory role. Miller is controversial figure, known as a key architect of the administration's hardline immigration policies.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ueno Bank scandal plunges Paraguay into political crisis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0576879f4e6ab95285a47013b2897cec30a74cfc59d40c87bc54eebbb09c9899</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:27Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T20:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ueno-bank-scandal-plunges-paraguay-into-political-crisis/a-79881388--35a7e5f2572b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ueno-bank-scandal-plunges-paraguay-into-political-crisis/a-79881388?mac