er Bavarian CSU, now it seems Christian Democrats nationwide plan to back her.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Meghan Markle's father arrested in US over child sex abuse material</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:115d546db17bbc74a1b81b83359b7d06c37ca7a5c45fbefadb4b10376f6b608c</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:27Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T18:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/meghan-markle-s-father-arrested-in-us-over-child-sex-abuse-material/a-79879676--52fd50a72dc3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/meghan-markle-s-father-arrested-in-us-over-child-sex-abuse-material/a-79879676?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US federal agents arrested Thomas Markle in Florida. The Duchess of Sussex and television actress Meghan Markle, who is estranged from her father, said she was "deeply distressed" by the charges.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iran war: Gulf tanker attacked, 1 seaferer killed</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:00a552df43470e6b64ee758be2c7025d7cd43781d1430f6e36255d953c3d5b87</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:27Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T17:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-war-gulf-tanker-attacked-1-seaferer-killed/a-79879270--c5d5ff882e32.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-gulf-tanker-attacked-1-seaferer-killed/a-79879270?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Iran is stepping up attacks on shipping in the Persian Gulf and Strait of Hormuz. A Greek-owned tanker believed to have been struck with a missile, and Iran said two other vessels were on fire.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Tesla to 'wind down' production of flop Cybertruck</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:008ab5b245fbb29e8a2667089220c2815706e9d242f67781f30a12a95161913a</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:27Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T17:10:00Z</