ed.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>What the Democrats' midterms win means for the US economy and Trump</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c53afe83e0ab9f6c91766d1dc52b36a045836414847557e799ad12e7e15e1a51</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:27Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T07:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-the-democrats-midterms-win-means-for-the-us-economy-and-trump/a-79853716--124f824b0e07.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-the-democrats-midterms-win-means-for-the-us-economy-and-trump/a-79853716?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From high oil prices and data centers to tariffs and mounting debt, economic concerns played a key role in the crushing defeat of President Donald Trump's Republicans. So can the Democrats now make a difference?</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>36 years later: Hungary opens Communist-era secret service files</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c339866eae944af84e66bd25319113229fa2ded6dbb5992a16fb91b2ba7f167e</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:27Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T19:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/36-years-later-hungary-opens-communist-era-secret-service-files/a-79858016--dc09772faa12.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/36-years-later-hungary-opens-communist-era-secret-service-files/a-79858016?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Decades after the end of Soviet rule, Hungary is releasing all its secret service files. The disclosure is sparking fresh debate about informants, guilt and responsibility.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>The 2011 discovery of neo-Nazi killers aired biases in German policing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:779f5239e3cf34368abad694c076045f268461245553cf620c764df743696c02</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:27Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T17:16:00Z</published>