s about machine-generated texts.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Art for freedom: Maria Kalesnikava in Bonn</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b9fe52a4a24015d6bda7630994a681f873021adfdcc2372ffdf5dd655df2314b</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:27Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T13:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/art-for-freedom-maria-kalesnikava-in-bonn/a-79612009--0f2314a86e67.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/art-for-freedom-maria-kalesnikava-in-bonn/a-79612009?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Belarusian musician and civil rights activist Maria Kalesnikava held the keynote speech on the importance of art at the 2026 Beethovenfest in Bonn. She also visited DW.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Finland, the world's happiest nation, faces a glum winter</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f00f4b3e0736fa49f7d026af2dffc96bd885a1f98080635a7d1eacc3264c39df</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:27Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T08:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/finland-the-world-s-happiest-nation-faces-a-glum-winter/a-79544348--0df829428818.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/finland-the-world-s-happiest-nation-faces-a-glum-winter/a-79544348?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Finns have many reasons to feel content, but the country's pile of debt is not one of them. Russia's war in Ukraine has added to the fiscal burden. Can the Nordic nation absorb another shock?</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
